WEBVTT

00:27.527 --> 00:29.362
There's another child in her belly.

00:29.446 --> 00:31.781
I knew it, she's having twins.

00:33.575 --> 00:35.702
It's almost dawn.

00:35.785 --> 00:37.871
Don't give birth yet!

00:37.954 --> 00:41.249
Granny! Don't ask for the impossible.

00:41.332 --> 00:42.375
But she has to!

00:43.543 --> 00:46.087
Even if it's impossible, just do it.

00:46.796 --> 00:52.886
Because these children will be the ones
who command the daemons!

01:19.162 --> 01:22.874
The children who sunder day and night
have been born.

01:34.219 --> 01:38.389
16 YEARS LATER

02:33.403 --> 02:35.446
What a beautiful dragon's fart.

02:58.469 --> 02:59.345
Oi! Yuru!

02:59.929 --> 03:02.932
Have ya gone huntin' alone again?

03:03.016 --> 03:05.351
Yo, Danji. I'm back.

03:05.852 --> 03:08.146
Why didn't ya tell me?

03:08.229 --> 03:09.063
My bad.

03:09.147 --> 03:11.983
What if somethin' happens to ya
all alone in the mountains?

03:12.734 --> 03:14.360
You can't call for help, ya know?

03:14.444 --> 03:15.737
It's fine.

03:16.321 --> 03:17.989
The Divine Guardians Right and Left
will protect me.

03:21.576 --> 03:22.452
Wow!

03:22.535 --> 03:24.454
Ya caught a pheasant!

03:24.537 --> 03:25.455
Wasn't that difficult?

03:25.538 --> 03:26.748
It was easy.

03:26.831 --> 03:29.459
- Let's have a grilled bird!
- No, a hot pot.

03:29.542 --> 03:31.628
It tastes and smells better
when it's grilled.

03:31.711 --> 03:33.296
Hot pot is more satisfying.

03:33.379 --> 03:34.380
Yer wrong!

03:36.466 --> 03:38.051
Oh, Yuru! Welcome back.

03:38.635 --> 03:39.469
I'm back.

03:39.552 --> 03:41.221
The weather looks like
it's going to get bad.

03:42.138 --> 03:44.057
Will we finally get some rain?

03:44.807 --> 03:46.309
I'll come help later.

03:46.392 --> 03:47.810
Yeah! Thanks!

04:04.327 --> 04:06.454
Granny Yamaha, I'm back.

04:06.537 --> 04:08.289
Welcome back, Yuru.

04:08.790 --> 04:10.708
Danji, perfect timing.

04:10.792 --> 04:12.585
Oh no, it's Ma!

04:12.669 --> 04:14.629
Come 'ere and help me!

04:14.712 --> 04:16.089
Bye!

04:16.172 --> 04:17.006
Hey!

04:17.090 --> 04:19.842
Learn to be a hard worker like Yuru!

04:20.343 --> 04:21.678
Is Asa well?

04:21.761 --> 04:25.807
She's doing her duty properly as always.

04:41.698 --> 04:42.699
Asa.

04:44.325 --> 04:45.285
How are you?

04:47.578 --> 04:48.830
Welcome back.

04:49.664 --> 04:50.873
Brother.

04:54.752 --> 04:56.379
I caught a pheasant today.

04:56.462 --> 04:58.673
You're amazing, Brother!

04:58.756 --> 05:00.383
Not really.

05:00.883 --> 05:03.553
I wanted to catch a boar or a deer.

05:04.053 --> 05:07.140
There hasn't been much rain this year,
so I'm worried about the harvest.

05:07.724 --> 05:10.226
There might be less food this winter.

05:10.727 --> 05:14.856
I have to hunt more
and make dried or salted meat.

05:15.356 --> 05:20.778
Will the adults of the village leave for
the outside world to find work?

05:21.362 --> 05:22.613
Maybe.

05:23.865 --> 05:25.700
Will you go, too?

05:25.783 --> 05:27.160
I won't!

05:27.660 --> 05:30.413
Why do you think I trained myself to hunt?

05:31.372 --> 05:34.167
If I become indispensable
to the village for hunting,

05:34.250 --> 05:36.627
I won't need to leave.

05:37.253 --> 05:41.924
You won't leave like
Mother and Father did?

05:42.008 --> 05:44.385
Don't worry, Asa.

05:44.469 --> 05:46.721
I'll never leave this village.

05:47.221 --> 05:50.433
As long as you're here,
I'll always be with you.

05:50.933 --> 05:52.143
I'll protect you.

05:55.605 --> 05:56.606
Yeah!

05:58.441 --> 05:59.358
Yuru!

06:00.818 --> 06:01.944
Yes?

06:03.154 --> 06:05.114
Dera is here.

06:06.157 --> 06:08.076
It's good steel.

06:09.202 --> 06:11.496
Here, from the folks who
went to the outside world.

06:11.579 --> 06:13.247
Thanks for always.

06:13.748 --> 06:15.124
How is it out there?

06:15.208 --> 06:17.710
The economy's pretty bad.

06:17.794 --> 06:19.921
There's a pandemic as well.

06:20.004 --> 06:23.007
Which is why, today,
I want to trade with some herbs.

06:23.674 --> 06:25.134
I'll trade this for salt.

06:25.218 --> 06:27.553
Do you have some vegetable seeds
that can grow in drought?

06:28.179 --> 06:29.555
Here you go.

06:29.639 --> 06:32.558
My daughter will soon be seven.

06:32.642 --> 06:33.643
I see.

06:33.726 --> 06:36.104
Then, I'll bring a witch doctor next time.

06:37.605 --> 06:40.316
I got some bad headaches lately.

06:40.858 --> 06:42.276
The usual painkillers, right?

06:42.860 --> 06:44.028
Stomach medicine, please.

06:44.112 --> 06:46.531
- Sure!
- Dera.

06:46.614 --> 06:49.075
Oh, Yuru! How are you?

06:49.617 --> 06:50.993
Anything you want?

06:52.161 --> 06:53.371
Not really...

06:54.539 --> 06:58.126
"I don't want anything.
Any souvenirs for Asa?"

06:58.209 --> 06:59.252
Right?

07:01.629 --> 07:02.755
Thanks.

07:03.256 --> 07:06.592
What?! Pheasant feathers? That's great!

07:06.676 --> 07:08.177
I can sell it for a good price.

07:12.348 --> 07:13.599
How lucky.

07:14.183 --> 07:16.769
I wanna leave this village too.

07:17.270 --> 07:19.313
Is the world out there really great?

07:20.106 --> 07:24.277
The folks who left rarely return.

07:24.819 --> 07:27.280
The outside world must be
a pretty good place.

07:27.363 --> 07:29.365
Really?

07:29.991 --> 07:32.702
I wouldn't mind living here my whole life.

07:33.369 --> 07:35.371
Yeah, right.

07:35.455 --> 07:38.541
Ya have a cute younger sister.

07:39.500 --> 07:42.253
Why don't ya leave with yer sister?

07:42.336 --> 07:44.714
If yer worried, I'll come with ya.

07:44.797 --> 07:48.593
Being with you will sully Asa.

07:48.676 --> 07:49.635
What did ya say?!

07:50.344 --> 07:52.430
She has an important duty!

07:53.014 --> 07:56.476
Come to think of it,
I've never met Asa at all.

07:57.101 --> 07:59.061
She can only meet with certain people.

07:59.145 --> 08:02.231
Don't say that, Big Bro.

08:02.315 --> 08:05.693
I won't let a peasant like you meet her.

08:05.776 --> 08:07.236
What?!

08:07.320 --> 08:09.322
Then, fight me first!

08:09.405 --> 08:10.656
No, no, no, I don't want to!

08:14.660 --> 08:15.745
What's this sound?

08:16.245 --> 08:18.164
Isn't it a dragon cry?

08:18.664 --> 08:19.540
Look.

08:20.291 --> 08:22.210
Again, beautiful dragon's fart.

08:32.803 --> 08:35.223
But it's not roaring.

08:35.306 --> 08:37.183
It's different from the usual.

08:37.850 --> 08:41.395
I've heard it many times
when I was hunting in the mountains.

08:42.104 --> 08:43.689
Isn't it getting loud?

08:44.190 --> 08:45.942
Maybe it's close.

08:46.025 --> 08:48.277
Have you ever seen a dragon?

08:48.361 --> 08:49.403
Nope.

09:12.718 --> 09:13.636
Look.

09:42.999 --> 09:44.584
Calm down!

10:04.520 --> 10:06.772
Wha...

10:18.326 --> 10:20.036
Gran! Granny Yamaha!

10:20.786 --> 10:22.121
What is happening?

10:22.204 --> 10:25.583
This is bad. The barrier has been broken.

10:25.666 --> 10:27.001
Just how?!

10:27.084 --> 10:30.129
I don't know,
but their target is probably Yuru.

10:31.213 --> 10:34.300
Anyway, hide him now. Bring him to me!

10:34.383 --> 10:35.217
Yeah!

10:35.885 --> 10:36.927
Where is Yuru?

10:37.011 --> 10:39.263
Probably in the field! Hurry up!

10:42.892 --> 10:44.018
What is happening?

10:44.769 --> 10:46.479
What the heck is happening here?

10:49.523 --> 10:51.359
Everyone was killed.

10:52.193 --> 10:54.028
Stay with me, Danji!

10:55.154 --> 10:57.239
Please live, Ma!

11:05.414 --> 11:06.290
We found him.

11:08.084 --> 11:09.085
Stop!

11:12.129 --> 11:13.422
Something weird just flew here!

11:13.506 --> 11:16.425
I don't know what that is,
but it's pretty destructive.

11:22.723 --> 11:25.184
The dragons are flying around
the outer walls!

11:25.851 --> 11:27.686
I don't think we can win against those.

11:28.187 --> 11:30.106
In the first place,
are those even dragons?

11:37.029 --> 11:41.242
I think Ma is workin'
at the keep like usual.

11:42.159 --> 11:44.662
Yer goin' there too for Asa, right?

11:45.621 --> 11:46.789
Help me, Danji.

11:47.373 --> 11:48.332
What now?

11:48.416 --> 11:49.959
Just help me!

11:58.467 --> 11:59.301
What is this?

12:00.302 --> 12:01.762
Shortcut to the keep.

12:01.846 --> 12:03.848
A shortcut? To the keep?

12:03.931 --> 12:05.850
I never knew about this!

12:05.933 --> 12:06.767
I told you...

12:07.476 --> 12:09.854
The Divine Guardians Right and Left
will protect us.

12:14.066 --> 12:16.235
Asa... Please be safe.

12:17.903 --> 12:19.363
Oi, Yuru!

12:29.582 --> 12:31.542
Hello there.

12:37.131 --> 12:38.090
Gobble.

12:44.722 --> 12:45.931
Gobble.

12:46.849 --> 12:47.933
Gobble. Gobble.

12:49.268 --> 12:50.227
Gobble. Gobble.

12:53.731 --> 12:54.940
Gobble.

13:05.743 --> 13:06.911
Ma...

13:08.204 --> 13:10.206
I won't bite children.

13:13.375 --> 13:14.376
Gobble.

13:18.047 --> 13:20.299
Hello, it's Gabby.

13:20.799 --> 13:23.511
I've taken over
the outer and middle areas.

13:25.054 --> 13:27.932
Ground squad, you can come here.

13:34.396 --> 13:35.648
Hello, ground squad?

13:37.233 --> 13:39.610
Hooo, boy.

13:39.693 --> 13:41.278
What to do now?

13:43.030 --> 13:45.324
The barrier's been broken.

13:46.742 --> 13:50.079
Hello? Hana, hun? It's me.

13:51.747 --> 13:54.458
Since I can contact you, this means bad.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.669
Can you see the smoke from there?

13:57.336 --> 13:58.587
I see.

13:59.255 --> 14:01.382
Can we change our meeting point?

14:03.467 --> 14:04.969
I think...

14:05.719 --> 14:07.179
Asa has come.

14:21.193 --> 14:24.572
So that's how it is.

14:29.368 --> 14:30.494
What a sick joke.

14:37.126 --> 14:38.002
What a sick joke.

14:58.606 --> 14:59.440
Asa!

15:00.357 --> 15:01.191
Yes.

15:01.692 --> 15:03.402
Asa is here, Brother.

15:03.986 --> 15:05.112
I've come to pick you.

15:06.322 --> 15:07.615
And...

15:09.992 --> 15:12.119
I will kill everyone besides you.

15:13.287 --> 15:14.246
What...

15:15.789 --> 15:18.083
What are you talking about?

15:20.044 --> 15:21.670
No way...

15:22.838 --> 15:23.839
Someone like you...

15:25.090 --> 15:27.676
Could be my sister!

15:27.760 --> 15:29.595
Get out of my way!

15:35.434 --> 15:38.812
So they're pretending to
be mountain rescuers.

15:47.613 --> 15:51.283
It'll be a problem if they keep going
along the escape route from above.

15:57.247 --> 15:58.207
Oh dear.

15:59.124 --> 16:01.126
Would you look at that?

16:01.210 --> 16:05.089
What a great set of teeth you have.

16:07.925 --> 16:08.759
Oh!

16:09.426 --> 16:11.762
Are you a Seer, mister?

16:16.642 --> 16:18.018
That's some strong enamel.

16:18.102 --> 16:21.730
Were you the one who eliminated
the ground squad?

16:33.659 --> 16:36.662
Sorry, I only meant to break the arrow.

16:38.288 --> 16:40.082
I'm still not used to this.

16:59.226 --> 17:01.061
Dera! Take Yuru and run!

17:07.401 --> 17:08.736
Hide in the outside world!

17:09.319 --> 17:10.988
Don't let them find him!

17:11.071 --> 17:12.239
Aye, aye!

17:13.657 --> 17:15.117
Ma, are you okay?

17:17.661 --> 17:18.495
Yuru?

17:19.079 --> 17:20.330
Yuru!

17:43.937 --> 17:46.857
Yuru, we'll descend the mountain.

17:47.858 --> 17:50.110
What is going on here?

17:50.903 --> 17:54.198
What is happening, really?

17:54.281 --> 17:55.824
Just follow me for now!

18:05.167 --> 18:07.294
Damn it! Missed our chance.

18:11.340 --> 18:14.718
If the girl with teeth comes,
we'll be trapped.

18:15.219 --> 18:16.303
Asa...

18:17.721 --> 18:19.306
Asa is dead.

18:20.891 --> 18:24.812
Wait. Is she? But she moved.

18:25.479 --> 18:27.481
We left Granny behind.

18:27.981 --> 18:29.733
Who was that woman?

18:30.484 --> 18:32.319
She killed everyone.

18:32.903 --> 18:35.823
Even though no one did anything wrong...

18:35.906 --> 18:38.534
No time to explain.

18:42.121 --> 18:44.039
You gotta use the Right and Left.

18:44.665 --> 18:46.542
Huh? The Divine Guardians?

18:46.625 --> 18:47.709
What do you mean by that?

18:48.210 --> 18:49.294
There.

18:50.129 --> 18:53.090
There's a hole between them.

18:53.173 --> 18:54.341
Put it into the hole.

18:56.051 --> 18:57.928
I don't understand!

18:58.011 --> 18:59.972
It's a present from me!

19:00.055 --> 19:01.807
Pre... what?

19:01.890 --> 19:02.975
Just do it!

19:03.559 --> 19:05.853
You do it, Yuru!

19:06.395 --> 19:08.897
Seriously! What's this all about exactly?!

19:09.481 --> 19:11.817
And no one explains anything!

19:13.652 --> 19:15.821
- The hole is filled with trash!
- Dig it!

19:17.990 --> 19:19.491
It's the boy.

19:19.575 --> 19:22.119
Capture him! You can kill the others!

19:22.202 --> 19:24.621
You should've cleaned that up properly!

19:26.165 --> 19:27.833
It's in, Dera!

19:30.669 --> 19:33.380
What was that for, Dera?!

20:01.116 --> 20:02.159
What are those?

20:37.694 --> 20:39.613
No!

20:42.824 --> 20:45.118
My ride home is gone.

20:45.994 --> 20:48.789
I hate walking down the mountain.

20:51.083 --> 20:52.459
Calm down, you two.

20:53.961 --> 20:56.004
Something's appeared.

20:57.005 --> 20:58.882
I wonder whose daemons?

20:59.841 --> 21:02.052
I hope they're weakling.

21:10.477 --> 21:12.729
Good grief.

21:13.480 --> 21:16.275
Our new master is a kid.

21:17.025 --> 21:19.695
He looks easy to get along with, Left.

21:20.696 --> 21:23.448
Be it a child or an adult,

21:23.532 --> 21:27.577
we have to obey our master, Right.

21:29.371 --> 21:32.499
Ghosts, demons, monsters,

21:32.582 --> 21:36.712
UMAs, spirits, pairs...

21:36.795 --> 21:41.550
Well, humans call them with
a lot of different names.

21:42.426 --> 21:46.138
Yuru, they are your daemons.

21:52.853 --> 21:53.895
Daemons?

22:11.872 --> 22:14.875
All the pain I've experienced

22:18.628 --> 22:23.216
Has traveled through my veins

22:25.343 --> 22:28.305
And passed through my heart

22:32.100 --> 22:35.479
By the time I've forgotten, it arrives

22:35.562 --> 22:36.521
In my brain

22:36.605 --> 22:38.607
I guess it's not that bad

22:38.690 --> 22:41.693
But there's this tiny little draft

22:41.777 --> 22:45.781
Of resentment and sadness

22:45.864 --> 22:50.202
Just let me have this

22:50.285 --> 22:53.413
I'm spineless

22:53.497 --> 22:57.084
All my words and tears

22:57.167 --> 23:00.796
And these feathers grown from my feelings

23:00.879 --> 23:03.757
I'll put all of them on my back

23:03.840 --> 23:06.927
Well, see you later

23:07.010 --> 23:10.806
I'll leave it all behind here

23:10.889 --> 23:12.057
I'm not scared

23:12.140 --> 23:14.184
Up in the sky

23:14.267 --> 23:17.104
See these feathers flutter in the wind

23:17.187 --> 23:22.526
And follow along

23:26.488 --> 23:28.907
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:28.990 --> 23:30.826
Above here leads to the village exit.

23:31.409 --> 23:32.327
Listen, Yuru.

23:33.286 --> 23:37.916
The Divine Guardians Right and Left
will always protect both of you.
